        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Ember Satchel infostealer sample, as reported in campaign PTF-01786. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Ember Satchel Infostealer: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-01786)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Ember Satchel Infostealer: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Ember Satchel infostealer in campaign PTF-01786.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"5d959ea98f1d056a15a09c7aedf8600341d1993620fc26f5c9740cf54159ae35\", \"73505c04bb67f8ebb03592700379064e0bf6a9f88bba1cedc1e40355b00ce30f\", \"078d9061001b0693fc6e978b541fde0d94eacbca7390fca4d18dc3216ab839f4\", \"a6a05af91212800cef93971bd1686b44aad7a8e56eeace5585c51f40a169198f\", \"dca07eb1eef98c60b9657d3e5624465dfb7b817537ce17d499d276aa035134d8\", \"d3a623a01872c7d060302ce7eeac12b1688f13aa891ed2a0df90e8889cee050f\", \"0fee83bb2d333b8844c9cddb04e106f7e1f3ddaff3e9b6fd1e5196dbe0c0f3c4\", \"4b2f60c6465114181620ada9394b8f7decf485114c1a748da2b3983153637478\", \"a4fe980f4832931f0c473e2def6693042467bb421f540ad79c3363c1a4eff1da\")",
